# #5837, condition 4 (a5e2e2ef): an orphan sibling's forward under the transfer and
# forward class. It edits an operator, not an action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestForwardNotAttributedToForwarder
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an orphan's forward is attributed only to the orphan sibling, so the live activation of the key's owner passes it
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithOrphanForward = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
        \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] = OrphanFwd /\ a # FwdToken}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no attribution to the forwarder.
        \cup {}
--- END
